        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1156147, 8 x 30 Black Push and Pull Handle Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSet of 8\" Center to Center (CTC)  offset door pull with a 30\" Center to Center (CTC) push bar. Made from 1\" diameter solid aluminum round bar stock. Packaged with heavy duty 3/8\" diameter screw mounting hardware. Black anodized aluminum finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1156147-30CTC Push and Pull Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 3-1/4\" (83 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2-1/4\" (57 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Offset for Mounting Point: 4\" (100 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Center to Center (CTC): 8\" (203 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 9\" (228 mm)</li>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Push Bar Diameter: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Projection: 2-1/4\" (57 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Clearance: 1-1/4\" (32 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Center to Center (CTC): 30\" </li>\r\n<li>Push Bar Total Length: 31\" (864 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" to 2-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 3/8-24 Screws</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Anodized Aluminum</b></li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set (for 1 door).</b>\r\n</p>",
